Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Blogs Entry No Guest Role
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	Then BlogsEntry view No Add Permissions
Scenario: Add Blogs Entry Org Role
Priority: 5
	Given Permissions set Up Org Role Login User PG
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|orgType|Organization|
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
		|portletName|Blogs|
		|roleTitle|Roles Orgrole Name|
		|roleType|Organization|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
		|siteURL|true|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	When Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
	And BlogsEntry view No Add Permissions
	And Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_BLOGS_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_BLOGS_ENTRIES_ADD_ENTRY_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Entry|
		|roleTitle|Roles Orgrole Name|
		|roleType|Organization|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_BLOGS_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_BLOGS_ENTRIES_ADD_ENTRY_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Entry|
		|roleTitle|Roles Orgrole Name|
		|roleType|Organization|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
		|siteName|Organization Name|
	And BlogsEntry view No Add Permissions
	Then User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
